* addq/subq of a difference of two vsect labels (before: "operands mismatch", as wants the
* quick value at once): written as the instruction word, the value in its field by an expression
* that as resolves at the end; as both Microware assemblers (forward: quick-label-diff-fwd).
* fixed: FIXME
* expect text: 5c88 5d41
 psect quick_label_diff,0,0,0,0,0
 vsect
Lab_a ds.w 3
Lab_b ds.w 1
 ends
 addq.l #Lab_b-Lab_a,a0
 subq.w #(Lab_b-Lab_a),d1
 ends
